# Title: A Rule Has Been Deleted From The Windows Firewall Exception List
# ID: c187c075-bb3e-4c62-b4fa-beae0ffc211f
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2022-02-19
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1686.003
# Description: Detects when a single rules or all of the rules have been deleted from the Windows Defender Firewall
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((EventID:"2006" OR EventID:"2052")) AND -(((ModifyingApplication:"") OR ((ModifyingApplication:C:\\Program Files (x86)\\* OR ModifyingApplication:C:\\Program Files\\* OR ModifyingApplication:C:\\Windows\\WinSxS\\*)) OR (-ModifyingApplication:*) OR (ModifyingApplication:"C:\\Windows\\System32\\svchost.exe"))) AND -((ModifyingApplication:C:\\ProgramData\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\Platform\\* AND ModifyingApplication:*\\MsMpEng.exe)))
